      "mergedPostDetails": "So I have noticed this... odd behavior just with the latest build. If the app has been fully closed around 12-24 hours and you open it, you have no sounds... at all. Even if you have full volume. Have not tested this with headphones, maybe they work, maybe not. I am not sure. But if you close the app and reopen it, all sounds work just fine.\n\nSteps to reproduce.\n\n1. Open the app and play.\n\n2. Close the app.\n\n3. Wait around 12-24 hours.\n\n4. Launch app->No sound.\n\n5. Close app.\n\n6. Launch app->Sound works just fine.\n\nVideo of the problem: https://prism.roitec.fi/share/ZI442TsRHqzd3lB_FF0pJu62H_5b9Ca2GRAkUztfu-KFv9v5STEi8xT5DGF8JPlGSNs\n\nGonna test out headphone theory tomorrow...ish\n\nDevice: iPhone 15 Pro Max\n\nOS: iOS 18.1 Dev Beta 6",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Sounds will not work if app has been closed around 12-24 hours but works after reopening the app",
